# Public analytics identifiers for the production build (rot509 / AU-509-1).
#
# These are safe PUBLIC browser identifiers — they ship in page source to
# every visitor — not secrets or API credentials. Vite loads this file for
# production builds (Vite root is client/; see vite.config.ts, which also
# resolves these through loadEnv). Without them, every tracker ID compiles
# EMPTY and the SPA analytics layer is inert: no GTM, no Meta pixel, and
# purchase / begin_checkout / cta_click / lead_attempt / offer_view can
# never fire. A shell environment variable of the same name overrides the
# value here at build time.
#
# House IDs: GTM-PZLMLZ5C is the fleet container; 1199658068992900 is the
# shared MehyarSoft Meta pixel (same as Designful / FloodLens / jobs);
# G-25N8E18944 is mehyar.us's own GA4 (also the consent-gated head tag).
MEHYAR_PUBLIC_GTM_ID=GTM-PZLMLZ5C
MEHYAR_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL_ID=1199658068992900
MEHYAR_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-25N8E18944
# MEHYAR_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_TAG_ID and MEHYAR_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_ID stay unset:
# no GT-/AW- identifier for mehyar.us exists on record — do not invent one.
# The GA4 measurement ID alone activates the generic analytics module, and
# the Google Ads loader stays a no-op until a real AW- ID exists.
